\par\par \b \uc2  BOJ disagrees sterilised  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  ineffective. \b0\par\par\uc2 322 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Dezember 1999\par 04:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Dec 1 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) cannot agree with the view, held mainly by foreign financial market players, that its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is ineffective if it is sterilised, a senior BOJ official said on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Asked if the BOJ's monetary policy was consistent with the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week to stem the yen's strength, Izumi Yamashita, director of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's financial markets department, said: "Our zero interest rate policy is effective in mitigating the yen's rise." \par \par \uc2  "Our monetary policy is more generous that those advocates of so-called unsterilised \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  suggest," Yamashita told reporters. \par \par \uc2  Yamashita said the whole argument of whether or not to sterilise \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was "meaningless" under the zero interest rate policy. \par \par \uc2  "What we are doing now is to check possible interest rate rises stemming from Y2K concerns," Yamashita said. \par \par \uc2  "The size of the daily fund surplus itself is technical. It does not signal anything now," he added. \par \par \uc2  Yamashita said a statement by BOJ Governor Masaru Hayami released earlier on Wednesday was aimed at correcting any misunderstanding over the relationship between \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy and monetary policy. \par \par \uc2  Hayami said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  supports the recent action by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and that it strongly hopes that market stability is quickly restored. \par \par \uc2  Hayami also said the bank will take into account the government's yen funding of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and will promptly provide sufficient funds to maintain stability in the money market. \par \par \uc2  Hayami's statement followed the BOJ's regular 0020 GMT money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  that left the daily fund surplus unchanged at one trillion yen. \par \par \uc2  The move disappointed some market players, who had been hoping that the bank would leave a bigger surplus and effectively unsterilise Monday's yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . ((Tokyo Newsroom +81-3 3432 9780 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvc108z8t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
