\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Euro off but safe from dollar parity again. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Svea Herbst-Bayliss \par \uc2 736 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Dezember 1999\par 23:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  NEW YORK, Dec 1 (Reuters) - Europe's single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , still \par \par \uc2  dangling close to numerical parity with the dollar, caught its \par \par \uc2  breath on Wednesday when the Japanese yen lost some luster \par \par \uc2  after Tokyo twice moved to restrain the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gains. \par \par \uc2  The euro slipped 0.13 percent against the dollar to close \par \par \uc2  at $1.0076 but swung to a small 0.48 percent gain against the \par \par \uc2  yen at 103.53 yen. The dollar meanwhile rose 0.56 percent \par \par \uc2  against the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to 102.69 yen. \par \par \uc2  The euro got off to a soft start when U.S. asset markets \par \par \uc2  cheered a strong report from America's manufacturing sector, \par \par \uc2  but its fortunes improved when dealers encountered strong \par \par \uc2  support near the $1.0050 level. \par \par \uc2  The market was abuzz with talk that European central banks \par \par \uc2  had bought euros for commercial purposes one day after the Bank \par \par \uc2  of Japan sold yen for euros and dollars in the open market in \par \par \uc2  an effort to brake the yen's recent sharp gains. \par \par \uc2  European officials have failed to express much concern \par \par \uc2  about the euro's seven percent fall in the last six weeks but \par \par \uc2  dealers nontheless remained worried about the prospect of \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action and decided to head to parity more slowly. \par \par \uc2  But most are convinced the level will be breached soon. \par \par \uc2  "Going into Thursday, I am looking for a test of the floor \par \par \uc2  at $1.0035 and a breach there, probably on Thursday, and then \par \par \uc2  moving to the next target which is the parity level.... I'm \par \par \uc2  looking to push through parity on Thursday or Friday," said \par \par \uc2  Mark Roberts, technical analyst at IDEAGlobal.com. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile the dollar, which has drawn strength from \par \par \uc2  America's red-hot economy, received another shot in the arm \par \par \uc2  from the Dow Jones industrial average, which rose 1.1 percent. \par \par \uc2  The closely watched National Association of Purchasing \par \par \uc2  Management (NAPM) index showed the sector at 56.2 in November \par \par \uc2  from 56.6 in October. This suggests industry is still growing \par \par \uc2  but not rapidly enough to spark fresh worries about economic \par \par \uc2  overheating, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  While economists viewed the overall report as neutral, \par \par \uc2  markets focused on the price component, which fell to 65.3 in \par \par \uc2  November from 69.4 in the prior month. \par \par \uc2  "Even though the actual NAPM number came in a little bit \par \par \uc2  weaker than expected, some of the components were Fed-friendly, \par \par \uc2  particularly the prices paid index," said Robert Houck, euro \par \par \uc2  trader at Norwest Bank in Minneapolis. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile the yen shied away from its highs as traders \par \par \uc2  remained on guard for further action by Tokyo to damp yen \par \par \uc2  strength in the days ahead even though the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  remained out of sight on Wednesday after \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday \par \par \uc2  and Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Overnight, speculation that the BoJ might effectively ease \par \par \uc2  monetary policy, later denied by Japanese officials, had \par \par \uc2  weighed on the yen. \par \par \uc2  Despite the market's brief reprieve from yen strength, \par \par \uc2  dealers said market psychology was still leaning heavily in the \par \par \uc2  yen's favour and the outlook remained negative for the euro. \par \par \uc2  "Because of either Y2K or year-end repatriation, capital is \par \par \uc2  probably likely still to flow toward Japan and possibly toward \par \par \uc2  the dollar," said Mike Malpede, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst \par \par \uc2  at Refco Group Ltd. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. employment report for November, scheduled for \par \par \uc2  release on Friday, could offer financial markets the latest \par \par \uc2  clue to the extent of U.S. economic growth and inflation, \par \par \uc2  dealers said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  bid prices at 2215GMT. All data taken from \par \par \uc2  Reuters with percent change calculated from the daily U.S. \par \par \uc2  close at 2130GMT. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par .\tab \tab \tab    US Close US Close  %Chg   YTD %  1998 Cls\par .\tab \tab \tab    01 Dec.  30 Nov.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -------------------------------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/dlr\tab \tab    1.0076   1.0089   -0.13  -13.92   1.1721\par Dlr/yen\tab \tab     102.69   102.12   +0.56  -13.92   113.20\par Euro/yen\tab \tab    103.53   103.04   +0.48   -9.79   131.84\par Dlr/swiss\tab \tab   1.5879   1.5871   +0.05  +15.55   1.3735\par Stg/dlr\tab \tab     1.6002   1.5984   +0.11   -3.36   1.6539\par Dlr/can\tab \tab     1.4727   1.4736   -0.06   -3.65   1.5295\par Aus/dlr\tab \tab     0.6364   0.6351   +0.20   +3.86   0.6115\par Euro/swiss\tab \tab  1.6011   1.6022   -0.07   -0.60   1.6119\par Euro/stg\tab \tab    0.6302   0.6305   -0.05  -10.20   0.7021\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ((U.S. Financial Markets Desk, 212-859-1639)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 D