\par\par \b \uc2  Mizoguchi - Watching  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  carefully, to act if needed. \b0\par\par\uc2 180 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 November 1999\par 01:15\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Nov 30 (Reuters) - Zembei Mizoguchi, head of the Japanese Finance Ministry's International Bureau, said on Tuesday he was watching the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets carefully and would act appropriately when needed. \par \par \uc2  "We are watching (the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) markets carefully," Mizoguchi told Reuters Television at the Finance Ministry. \par \par \uc2  "We will act appropriately if it is necessary," he said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets on Monday, selling yen for dollars after the yen dipped to the 101 yen level in overseas trade. \par \par \uc2  Mizoguchi did not comment on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels, but reiterated Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, saying that a rapid yen appreciation was unfavourable. \par \par \uc2  When asked about the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stance on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Mizoguchi said: "I cannot comment on the ECB." \par \par \uc2  Mizoguchi also added that there was no change in the G7's statement on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  issued in September. \par \par \uc2  The dollar stood at 102.50/51 versus the yen at 0005 GMT. ((Tokyo newsroom (813) 3432-8022 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvbu094ma\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
