\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Yen climbs, euro falls as  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  ignored. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Svea Herbst-Bayliss \par \uc2 732 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 November 1999\par 23:26\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  NEW YORK, Nov 30 (Reuters) - The yen climbed and the euro \par \par \uc2  sank again on Tuesday as investors dismissed Japan's efforts to \par \par \uc2  restrain the yen's runaway gains and bet Europe will not stage \par \par \uc2  a rescue mission to prop up the 11-month old single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At the end of the day, the yen traded 0.21 percent higher \par \par \uc2  against the dollar and was up 0.32 percent against the euro. \par \par \uc2  The euro was nearly flat against the dollar, having pared its \par \par \uc2  losses to 0.04 percent. \par \par \uc2  But the small changes masked the day's volatile moves \par \par \uc2  sparked by another round of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , comments from \par \par \uc2  European heads of government and central bankers and the wait \par \par \uc2  for the world's three major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to reach numerical \par \par \uc2  parity. \par \par \uc2  In Asian trading hours the Bank of Japan sold yen for \par \par \uc2  dollars and euros, coming into the market for the second time \par \par \uc2  in two days to smooth market movements. \par \par \uc2  Officials have long worried a surging yen could choke off \par \par \uc2  Japan's fragile economic recovery but the bank's repeated \par \par \uc2  rounds of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  failed to pack much punch, sending the \par \par \uc2  yen only briefly lower on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  "We are sceptical that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will reverse or even \par \par \uc2  halt the yen's appreciation," said Warburg Dillon Read analyst \par \par \uc2  Tomas Jelf. The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  also does not \par \par \uc2  "herald coordinated G-3 action, and certainly does not signal a \par \par \uc2  policy change in the U.S. or Europe," he added. \par \par \uc2  Dealers jumped on a joint statement from German Chancellor \par \par \uc2  Gerhard Schroeder and French President Jacques Chirac that \par \par \uc2  there was no reason to worry too much about the euro. \par \par \uc2  The comments echoed an equally relaxed attitude at Europe's \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  where the top banker, Wim Duisenberg, on Monday \par \par \uc2  gave no hints that an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was being planned. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile the governor of France's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Jean \par \par \uc2  Claude Trichet, said the euro has room to appreciate and Klaus \par \par \uc2  Dieter Kuehbacher, president of a state \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \par \par \uc2  Germany, said the euro could be at $1.08 early next year. \par \par \uc2  "The market, at this point, is not betting that there's any \par \par \uc2  commitment to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  (by the ECB)," said Hillel Waxman, \par \par \uc2  chief \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Bank Leumi U.S.A. "(The ECB's) concern is \par \par \uc2  inflation and not value of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \uc2  U.S. Treasury Secretary Lawrence Summers again said the \par \par \uc2  administration was watching \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets and insisted \par \par \uc2  nothing had changed about America's strong dollar policy. \par \par \uc2  For traders this provided a sometimes mixed message leaving \par \par \uc2  them to try and push the yen higher and euro lower but failing \par \par \uc2  to reach fresh life records during the New York day. \par \par \uc2  Thinned trading volumes ahead of the end of the month and \par \par \uc2  heading into the end of the year helped exaggerate swings in \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates, dealers said. "Liquidity is at a desperate \par \par \uc2  premium," said John Hazelton, trader at PNC Bank. \par \par \uc2  As \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  moved in different directions, dealers said \par \par \uc2  the action was now being driven more by technical factors \par \par \uc2  rather than fundamental issues. \par \par \uc2  They noted that a little good news in Japan seemed to help \par \par \uc2  the yen much more than it should while a little bad news in \par \par \uc2  Europe was hurting the euro disproportionately. \par \par \uc2  In terms of trying to reach numerical parity, Mellon Bank \par \par \uc2  trader Grant Wilson said, "We probably will end up there sooner \par \par \uc2  or later just because it gives the market something to shoot \par \par \uc2  for." \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  bid prices at 2217GMT. All data taken from \par \par \uc2  Reuterswith percent change calculated from the daily U.S. close \par \par \uc2  at 2130GMT. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par .\tab \tab \tab    US Close US Close  %Chg   YTD %  1998 Cls\par .\tab \tab \tab    30 Nov.  29 Nov.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -------------------------------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/dlr\tab \tab    1.0089   1.0093   -0.04  -13.89   1.1721\par Dlr/yen\tab \tab     102.12   102.33   -0.21  -13.89   113.20\par Euro/yen\tab \tab    103.04   103.37   -0.32   -9.60   131.84\par Dlr/swiss\tab \tab   1.5871   1.5875   -0.03  +15.58   1.3735\par Stg/dlr\tab \tab     1.5984   1.6064   -0.50   -2.87   1.6539\par Dlr/can\tab \tab     1.4736   1.4734   +0.01   -3.67   1.5295\par Aus/dlr\tab \tab     