\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Euro struggles to hold above life lows. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Elizabeth Lazarowitz \par \uc2 638 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 November 1999\par 16:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  NEW YORK, Nov 30 (Reuters) - Europe's single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was \par \par \uc2  precipitously close to lifetime lows in early U.S. trade on \par \par \uc2  Tuesday as dealers, sure that Europe would take a hands-off \par \par \uc2  policy toward the euro, fixed their sights on parity. \par \par \uc2  The euro got a short pop after Bundesbank council member \par \par \uc2  Klaus-Dieter Kuehbacher was quoted on German radio as saying he \par \par \uc2  expected the euro to rebound to around $1.08 from current lows \par \par \uc2  after the year 2000 changeover. \par \par \uc2  But the European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  erased its gains in relatively \par \par \uc2  short order and headed back toward session lows near $1.0050. \par \par \uc2  "The market, at this point, is not betting that there's any \par \par \uc2  commitment to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  (by the ECB)," said Hillel Waxman, \par \par \uc2  chief \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Bank Leumi U.S.A. "(The ECB's) concern is \par \par \uc2  inflation and not value of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \uc2  The euro had tumbled nearly a quarter of a cent in European \par \par \uc2  trading hours after French President Jacques Chirac and German \par \par \uc2  Chancellor Gerhard Schroeder said they are not worried by the \par \par \uc2  level of the euro against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Schroeder also said the importance of the level of the \par \par \uc2  euro/dollar should not be exaggerated. \par \par \uc2  Chirac added that the euro zone economy is doing well, and \par \par \uc2  he has every confidence in the euro, and later said that the \par \par \uc2  euro has significant room for appreciation. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the 11-nation euro would likely continue to \par \par \uc2  find itself drawn to the psychological level of one-on-one \par \par \uc2  parity with the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "We probably will end up there sooner or later just because \par \par \uc2  it gives the market something to shoot for," said Grant Wilson, \par \par \uc2  vice president and trader at Mellon Bank. \par \par \uc2  At 10:37 a.m. (1537 GMT), the euro stood at $1.0067, down \par \par \uc2  from $1.0093 late Monday. \par \par \uc2  While dealers largely shrugged off the possibility of \par \par \uc2  action by Europe's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the market was extremely \par \par \uc2  jittery about further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  after \par \par \uc2  the BoJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  repeatedly overnight to rein in the yen. \par \par \uc2  The dollar hugged 102 yen in U.S. morning dealing after \par \par \uc2  shooting to highs above 103 yen in Asian trading after the BoJ \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Late on Monday, the dollar stood at 102.33 yen. \par \par \uc2  Senior \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  official Haruhiko Kuroda \par \par \uc2  confirmed that the BoJ bought dollars for yen for the second \par \par \uc2  time this week and said he was concerned that the recent \par \par \uc2  drastic yen rise could hurt \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's economy. \par \par \uc2  Bankers said the BoJ's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  also included buying of \par \par \uc2  euros for yen, although Kuroda declined to comment on \par \par \uc2  euro-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, thinned trading volumes ahead of the end of the \par \par \uc2  month and heading into the end of the year were helping \par \par \uc2  exaggerate swings in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Liquidity is at a desperate premium," said John Hazelton, \par \par \uc2  trader at PNC Bank. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  bid prices at 1504GMT.  All data taken from \par \par \uc2  Reuters with percent change calculated from the daily U.S. \par \par \uc2  close at 2130GMT. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par .\tab \tab \tab     Last    US Close  % Chg   YTD %   1998\par .\tab \tab \tab \tab \tab   29 Nov.\tab \tab      Close\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -----------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/dlr\tab    1.0065   1.0093   -0.28   -14.13   1.1721\par Dlr/yen\tab    101.97   102.33   -0.35   -14.13   113.20\par Euro/yen\tab 102.59   103.37   -0.75    -9.92   131.84\par Dlr/swiss\tab  1.5907   1.5875   +0.20   +15.81   1.3735\par Stg/dlr\tab     1.5946   1.6064   -0.73    -3.59   1.6539\par Can/dlr\tab     1.4745   1.4734   +0.07    -3.60   1.5295\par Aus/dlr\tab     0.6347   0.6371   -0.38    +3.79   0.6115\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/swiss EURCHF=)    1.6016   1.6034   -0.11    -0.64   1.6119\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/stg  EURGBP=)    0.6307   0.6279   +0.45   -10.17   0.7021\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ((U.S. Financial Markets Desk, 212-859-1868)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvbu08yrb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
