\par\par \b \uc2  SIMEX Nikkei off lows on BOJ moves, jitters remain. \b0\par\par\uc2 386 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 November 1999\par 09:13\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      SINGAPORE, Nov 29 (Reuters) - SIMEX Nikkei futures ended \par \par \uc2  off their lows on Monday after the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  to prop up the dollar helped calm nerves. \par \par \uc2      But the market failed to close in positive territory as \par \par \uc2  investors grappled with concerns that the impact of the \par \par \uc2  government's moves might be short-lived. \par \par \uc2      Traders said the yen's resurgence had sparked worries about \par \par \uc2  the export competitiveness of Japanese firms and the economic \par \par \uc2  recovery. \par \par \uc2      "Funds used (the strong yen) as an excuse to sell. They \par \par \uc2  said it would affect some companies' bottom lines and the \par \par \uc2  recovery. But personally, I don't see any reason why they \par \par \uc2  should be worried," said a broker at a local brokerage. \par \par \uc2  "The strong yen should reflect the fact that Japan is \par \par \uc2  solidly recovering. Export revenues do not make up a big chunk \par \par \uc2  of the country's GDP anyway," he said. \par \par \uc2  Other traders said players were reluctant to buy actively \par \par \uc2  because they doubted if the yen rise was stoppable under the \par \par \uc2  current circumstances. \par \par \uc2  "If the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not do anything, Japan \par \par \uc2  alone won't be able to stop the yen. If the strong yen is \par \par \uc2  really a concern in the market, then we can't expect any active \par \par \uc2  buying," said a trader at a European house. \par \par \uc2      They see strong near-term support at 18,600 and a key \par \par \uc2  barrier at 19,000. \par \par \uc2      SIMEX Taiwan futures were buoyed by strong gains in the \par \par \uc2  cash market as concerns over tensions between mainland China \par \par \uc2  and Taiwan subsided. \par \par \uc2      Rumours of Chinese naval excercises off Taiwan sparked a \par \par \uc2  sell-off on Friday, but Taiwanese authorities dismissed the \par \par \uc2  rumours as groundless. \par \par \uc2     The market is expected to be well-supported by the \par \par \uc2  resilient \par \par \uc2  performance of the technology-heavy Nasdaq, which Taiwan \par \par \uc2  stocks track, traders said. \par \par \uc2      SIMEX NIKKEI 225 FUTURES \par \par \uc2   Contract...... DEC9........... MAR0 \par \par \uc2   Settlement.....18840..........18840 \par \par \uc2   High...........18910..........18880 \par \par \uc2   Low............18740..........18760 \par \par \uc2   Prev Close.....18890..........18885 \par \par \uc2   Net Change......-105............-45 \par \par \uc2   Volume.........10521............401 \par \par \uc2       SIMEX TAIWAN MSCI FUTURES \par \par \uc2   Contract........ NOV9........ DEC9 \par \par \uc2   Settlement......354.4.........356.6 \par \par \uc2   High............354.5.........357.0 \par \par \uc2   Low.............347.5.........348.6 \par \par \uc2   Prev Close......345.5.........347.1 \par \par \uc2   Net Change........8.9...........9.5 \par \par \uc2   Volume...........2433..........6644 \par \par \uc2      ((Anchalee Koetsawang (65) 870-3087;fax (65) 870-3787; \par \par \uc2  email: asia.\b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 @reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvbt09a5b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
