\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2  - Euro dips to record lows vs yen, dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Elizabeth Lazarowitz \par \uc2 779 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 November 1999\par 19:32\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  NEW YORK, Nov 29 (Reuters) - Europe's battle-weary single \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  extended its losses in U.S. morning trading on Monday, \par \par \uc2  slipping to lifetime lows against the dollar and the Japanese \par \par \uc2  yen. \par \par \uc2  The European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  tumbled as low as $1.0038 and 102.34 \par \par \uc2  yen as investors continued to sell the euro amid doubts that \par \par \uc2  European economies can compete with robust U.S. growth and \par \par \uc2  signs that Japan's economic recovery is steaming ahead. \par \par \uc2  Remarks from European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Wim Duisenburg \par \par \uc2  that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets remained a \par \par \uc2  "potential weapon" briefly buoyed the euro, but dealers doubted \par \par \uc2  there will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  any time soon. \par \par \uc2  Overnight the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  tried to stem the yen's rise \par \par \uc2  against the dollar and euro, but dealers said the bank appeared \par \par \uc2  to be isolated in its effort. \par \par \uc2  "I think the ECB is pretty comfortable with the way things \par \par \uc2  are," said Henry Willmore, senior economist at Barclays \par \par \uc2  Capital. "They're trying to promote export-led growth, so it \par \par \uc2  wouldn't make sense for them to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \uc2  "You have to come up with a very creative response (to the \par \par \uc2  euro's decline). They didn't," said Paul Podolsky, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  strategist at BankBoston. "That's going to make it crystal \par \par \uc2  clear they're not going to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the euro, which \par \par \uc2  gives people a little more enthusiasm to sell it." \par \par \uc2  Duisenberg testified before the European Parliament and \par \par \uc2  offered a brighter medium-term outlook, saying the euro can \par \par \uc2  only go higher and that growth in the euro region would outpace \par \par \uc2  growth in the U.S. in two year's time. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par At 12:00 p.m. (1700 GMT), the euro\tab   stood at\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par $1.0100/05, off its session lows, but still well below late\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Friday levels near $1.0164. The euro also pared its sizable\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par losses against the yen to hover a full yen above its lows.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Meanwhile, the dollar\tab   managed to find its footing\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par against the Japanese yen, erasing its overnight losses to stand\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par at 102.34, up from 101.75 at the close of trading on Friday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Market players remained on guard for more \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  after Japanese Finance Minister Kiichi\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Miyazawa confirmed the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  bought dollars and sold yen\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market during Asian trading hours.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Jitters over potential \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  helped give the dollar\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par mild support, but dealers said the market appears ready to test\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's resolve.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Tokyo is concerned the soaring yen could hurt Japan's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par fledgling recovery by raising the price of exports.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "It's relentless," said Fortis vice president John Schein\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of the yen's seemingly uncontainable strength.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "I have a very good feeling this thing is going to go to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 101, if this continues," he added.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Japanese Vice Finance Minister Nobuaki Usui said on Monday\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the BoJ is prepared to keep taking decisive action for\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par stability in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But dealers said another solo \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the Bank of\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would likely have little more than a fleeting effect.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "A real coordinated effort, a massive effort -- this is the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par only way you would have some effectiveness, and only on a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par temporary basis," Fortis' Schein said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The euro began to lose its footing in European trading\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par after Bundesbank council member Klaus-Dieter Kuehbacher said it\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par could test parity with the dollar on Monday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Later, the European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  came under further pressure\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par after ECB council member Klaus Liebscher was quoted as saying\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par he was "not a great supporter" of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Following the euro's lead, the Swiss franc\tab     also\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par pared its losses against the dollar, but only after slumping to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par a decade-low of 1.5975 per dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  bid prices at 1757GMT.  All data taken from Reuters\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par with percent change calculated from the daily U.S. close at\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2130GMT.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par .\tab \tab \tab    Last    US Close  % Chg   YTD %    1998\par .\tab \tab \tab \tab      26 Nov.\tab \tab \tab   Close\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -----------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/dlr\tab \tab    1.0096   1.0164   -0.67   -13.86   1.1721\par Dlr/yen\tab \tab     102.26   101.75   +0.50   -13.86   113.20\par Euro/yen\tab \tab    103.22   103.28   -0.06    -9.66   131.84\par Dlr/swiss\tab \tab   1.5876   1.5772   +0.66   +15.59   1.3735\par Stg/dlr\tab \tab     1.6024   1.6063   -0.24    -3.11   1.6539\par Can/dlr\tab \tab     1.4756   1.4681   +0.51    -3.52   1.5295\par Aus/dlr\tab \tab     0.6370   0.6346   +0.38    +4.17   0.6115\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/swiss    1.6034   1.6023   +0.07    -0.53   1.6119\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/stg\tab \tab    0.6295   0.6321   -0.41   -10.34   0.7021\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ((U.S. Financial Markets Desk, 212-859-1868)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvbt094oh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
