\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Bruised euro slumps to life lows vs dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Elizabeth Lazarowitz \par \uc2 779 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 November 1999\par 15:49\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par NEW YORK, Nov 29 (Reuters) - Europe's single \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par slumped to fresh lifetime lows against the dollar in early U.S.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  trading, continuing last week's slide, and edged perilously \par \par \uc2  close to all-time lows against the Japanese yen. \par \par \uc2  The euro fell as low as $1.0050 just as the New York \par \par \uc2  session got underway, only a half a cent away from the \par \par \uc2  psychologically significant one-on-one level with the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "It's a continuation of the theme that we saw last \par \par \uc2  week...the continued underperformance of European economies \par \par \uc2  with respect to the U.S. economy and also with respect the \par \par \uc2  Japanese economy," said Alex Beuzelin, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst \par \par \uc2  at Ruesch International. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the strong technical magnetism of parity and \par \par \uc2  comments from European officials that seemed to show that they \par \par \uc2  are indifferent to the euro's plight, also conspired to send \par \par \uc2  the euro plunging lower. \par \par \uc2  "We are continuing to hear mixed messages out of the euro \par \par \uc2  zone and so that translates into diminished likelihood \par \par \uc2  of ECB \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Beuzelin said, adding that that market \par \par \uc2  mind-set prepares the way for further euro weakness. \par \par \uc2  At 9:00 a.m. (1400 GMT), the euro stood at $1.0072, down \par \par \uc2  nearly a full cent from $1.0164 late Friday. The European \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also hovered tenuously above lifetime lows against the \par \par \uc2  yen near 102.40 set on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the dollar was licking its wounds after erasing \par \par \uc2  most of the gains it made against the yen overnight when the \par \par \uc2  Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Japanese Finance Minister Kiichi Miyazawa confirmed on \par \par \uc2  Monday that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, buying dollars for yen in Asian trading \par \par \uc2  hours. It was its first such action in more than two months. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But the dollar\tab     swiftly reversed direction and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par slumped to a fresh session low of 101.64 in early U.S. trading,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par before paring its losses to about 102 yen, up slightly from\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 101.75 late Friday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers said they were on guard for more \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the BoJ, but the market appeared ready to test the Japanese\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's resolve to curb yen strength.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Tokyo is concerned the soaring yen could hurt Japan's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par fledgling recovery by raising the price of exports.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "It's relentless," said Fortis vice president John Schein\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par about the yen's seemingly uncontainable strength.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "I have a very good feeling this thing is going to go to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 101, if this continues," he added.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Japanese Vice Finance Minister Nobuaki Usui said on Monday\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par says the BoJ is prepared to keep taking decisive action for\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par stability in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market, although he declined\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to comment on present yen levels.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers said another solo \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par would likely have little more than a fleeting effect, since the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par market is already on their guard for \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  action.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In addition, the BoJ would be fighting a deeply entrenched\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par trend of weakness in the dollar against the yen.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "A real coordinated effort, a massive effort--this is the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par only way you would have some effectiveness, and only on a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par temporary basis," Fortis' Schein said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The euro began to lose its footing in European trading\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par after Bundesbank council member Klaus-Dieter Kuehbacher said it\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par could test parity with the dollar on Monday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Later, the European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  came under further pressure\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par after ECB council member Klaus Liebscher was quoted as saying\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par he was "not a great supporter" of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Swept in the euro's wake, the Swiss franc\tab     tumbled to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par its lowest levels of this decade against the dollar, slumping\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par as low as 1.5942 francs per dollar. The dollar was also firmer\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par against the British pound\tab  .\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  bid prices at 1433GMT. All data taken from\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Reuters with percent change calculated from the daily U.S.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par close at 2130GMT.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par .\tab \tab \tab      Last     US Close  % Chg   YTD %   1998\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Close\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par .\tab \tab \tab \tab \tab   26 Nov.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -----------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/dlr\tab \tab     1.0064   1.0164   -0.98   -14.14\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1.1721\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dlr/yen\tab \tab      101.96   101.75   +0.21   -14.14\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 113.20\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/yen\tab \tab     102.63   103.28   -0.63    -9.93\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 131.84\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dlr/swiss\tab \tab    1.5923   1.5772   +0.96   +15.93\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1.3735\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Stg/dlr\tab \tab      1.6001   1.6063   -0.39    -3.25\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1.6539\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Can/dlr\tab \tab      1.4724   1.4681   +0.29    -3.73\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1.5295\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Aus/dlr\tab \tab      0.6364   0.6346   +0.28    +4.07\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0.6115\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/swiss\tab \tab   1.6032   1.6023   +0.06    -0.54\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1.6119\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/stg\tab \tab     0.6290   0.6321   -0.49   -10.41\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0.7021\par \f28 \par \par \uc2