\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dollar/yen rejects post- \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  highs. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Deepthi Wickremasinghe \par \uc2 589 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 November 1999\par 09:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, Nov 29 (Reuters) - The yen firmed on Monday rejecting lows against both the dollar and the euro seen overnight after repeated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on dollar/yen from the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Government officials confirmed that the BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars against yen for the first time in over two months. The BOJ was seen bidding the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at around 103 yen every time it was pushed down by an array of selling led by Japanese exporters and U.S. banks. \par \par \uc2  The European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment on talk from Tokyo bankers that the BOJ was seen buying euros for yen. Nevertheless analysts said the crucial question now was whether the ECB would step in. \par \par \uc2  "The BOJ really just wants to calm down the volatility in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, but not reverse the trend," said Klaus Kusber, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at Dresdner Kleinwort Benson in Frankfurt. \par \par \uc2  "Only if the ECB steps in will it impress the markets, but we don't think they will. The ECB is very keen on giving the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets the impression that it has a benign neglect policy." \par \par \uc2  The dollar was about two yen above four-year lows around 101.25 set on Friday having backed off an overnight high above 104. \par \par \uc2  Euro/yen was two yen above its life low of 102.41 according to Reuters Graphics, set on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile euro/dollar was within half a cent of its $1.0073 life low set on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Bundesbank council member Klaus-Dieter Kuehbacher said on Monday that he did not rule out the euro could reach parity against the dollar on Monday. \par \par \uc2  "This is not a statement a Bundesbank member normally makes so I am really surprised and curious about what the ECB does today," said Dresdner's Kusber. \par \par \uc2  "Unless the ECB steps in and helps the BOJ, the underlying trends of euro down and yen up will be resumed." \par \par \uc2  MIYAZAWA CONFIRMS BOJ SOLD YEN \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the market would also take a keen interest in ECB President Wim Duisenberg's comments on the euro when he appears before the European Parliament's economic and monetary affairs committee at 1400 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Following the BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Finance Minister Kiichi Miyazawa confirmed the bank had sold yen for dollars but said he did not want to discuss the possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to boost the euro against the yen. \par \par \uc2  Miyazawa said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not aimed at setting a long-term trend. \par \par \uc2  The market consensus was that the range of the dollar against the yen had come down to around 100-105 yen for the rest of this year. \par \par \uc2  Traders said they did not think the BOJ would leave Monday's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  unsterilised - leaving the pool of yen it sold in the market following the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  - after holding pat at a Policy Board meeting last Friday. \par \par \uc2  But a dealer at a Japanese city bank said, "The market will be watching how much liquidity the BOJ leaves in the money market at its \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  on December 1." \par \par \uc2  Settlements of spot \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions are made two business days after they are conducted. \par \par \uc2  If the BOJ increases the fund surplus in the money market from one trillion yen at its 0020 GMT daily \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday, it would be viewed as having left the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  unsterilised, dealers said. ((London capital markets, +44 171 542 7792, fax +44 171 542 5285, deepthi.wickremasinghe@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvbt090ts\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
