\par\par \b \uc2  Miyazawa says will  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  if needed - Jiji. \b0\par\par\uc2 231 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 November 1999\par 10:52\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Nov 26 (Reuters) - Japanese Finance Minister Kiichi Miyazawa said on Friday that he has instructed his ministry to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market if necessary, Jiji news agency reported. \par \par \uc2  "I told the officials in charge to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if they needed to. But if they have not done so, it most likely means they have not done so," Jiji quoted Miyazawa as saying. \par \par \uc2  Asked where Miyazawa made the reported comment, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  was unable to confirm but said that he was not speaking at a press conference, nor was one planned by him later. \par \par \uc2  The yen climbed against both the euro and the dollar Friday. The euro slid to record lows versus the yen at 105.55, while the dollar fell below the 104 yen level. \par \par \uc2  Japan's Vice Finance Minister for International Affairs, Haruhiko Kuroda, stepped up verbal warnings on Thursday and Friday, saying the euro was too weak against both the yen and the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Kuroda said on Friday the euro had a lot of room to rise against the yen and the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Kuroda's office and the MOF's international bureau manage \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy and instruct the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on their behalf. ((Tokyo newsroom (813) 3432-8022 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvbq099e0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
