\par\par \b \uc2  Euro too weak given EU prospects - Japan's Kuroda. \b0\par\par\uc2 237 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 November 1999\par 02:10\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Nov 26 (Reuters) - Senior Japanese Finance Ministry official Haruhiko Kuroda reiterated on Friday that the euro was "too weak", saying its decline was temporary given economic growth prospects for the European Union. \par \par \uc2  "The euro, in particular, is too weak," the vice minister for international affairs told reporters as he entered the ministry. "It has a lot of room to rise against both the yen and the dollar." \par \par \uc2  Kuroda was asked about the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, where the euro plumbed fresh lifetime lows on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Given that the European Union has forecast growth of some three percent next year, Kuroda said, the euro's weakness is temporary. He declined to say how long he thought the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would remain weak. \par \par \uc2  Kuroda said he was unaware of a remark overnight by European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  board member Eugenio Domingo Solans, who said the ECB had no intention of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to defend the euro. \par \par \uc2  He brushed off a question about whether \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb the yen's rise against the euro, saying only: "On \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , or on \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, there is no change in our position." \par \par \uc2  Ministry officials have said their \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy is that a rapid yen rise is unfavourable and that they will respond as appropriate. ((William Mallard, Tokyo newsroom +81-3 3432-8022 email: tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvbq0976s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
