\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Frail euro falls to lows vs major  \highlight22\uc2 currencies \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Carolyn Cohn \par \uc2 605 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 November 1999\par 10:27\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, Nov 26 (Reuters) - The euro hit four-month lows \par \par \uc2  against the dollar and life lows against yen and sterling on \par \par \uc2  Friday, as recent conflicting comments on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \par \par \uc2  European central bankers fanned bearishness about its prospects. \par \par \uc2  The single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was already suffering this week from \par \par \uc2  loss of credibility in euro zone structural reform, after \par \par \uc2  government \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to rescue German construction giant \par \par \uc2  Holzmann. \par \par \uc2  This added to the negative response by the euro to the \par \par \uc2  European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decision to raise interest rates by half \par \par \uc2  a percentage point to 3.0 percent on November 4, a move \par \par \uc2  considered aggressive for the region's fragile economic \par \par \uc2  recovery. \par \par \uc2  "The major problem for now is the credibility, which is not \par \par \uc2  very high in terms of European politicians and the ECB," said \par \par \uc2  Michael Rottmann, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at HypoVereinsbank in \par \par \uc2  Munich. \par \par \uc2  MANY VIEWS ON \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  The credibility of the ECB was undermined after board member \par \par \uc2  Eugenio Domingo Solans said on Thursday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had no \par \par \uc2  intention of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to \par \par \uc2  defend the euro. \par \par \uc2  ECB Chief Economist Otmar Issing, in contrast, said also on \par \par \uc2  Thursday that central banks should not flag \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  but \par \par \uc2  should keeep speculators guessing until after the event. \par \par \uc2  European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Wim Duisenberg added to the \par \par \uc2  fray on Friday. The Financial Times reported he said he would be \par \par \uc2  concerned if the euro fell further. \par \par \uc2  But he said the euro's external exchange rate would matter, \par \par \uc2  in economic terms, only if it had a strong impact on euro-zone \par \par \uc2  inflation. "Does the actual movement give rise to concern? The \par \par \uc2  answer is no. It doesn't matter very much." \par \par \uc2  JOINT \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  IN DOUBT \par \par \uc2  Analysts and dealers said the comments cast doubt on the \par \par \uc2  likelihood of joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the euro and curb \par \par \uc2  the yen's strength. Previously, the ECB \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on behalf of \par \par \uc2  the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) on June 18, buying euros for yen. \par \par \uc2  "If we take the ECB's comments at face value, it seems \par \par \uc2  difficult for Japanese authorities to persuade the Europeans to \par \par \uc2  agree to taking action to help stem the yen's rise against the \par \par \uc2  euro," a bank dealer in Tokyo said. \par \par \uc2  Vice Minister for International Affairs Haruhiko Kuroda \par \par \uc2  reiterated on Friday that the euro was "too weak", saying its \par \par \uc2  decline was temporary given economic growth prospects for the \par \par \uc2  European Union. \par \par \uc2  The euro fell to a low of $1.0135, its weakest since \par \par \uc2  July 19. Against the yen, it fell to an all-time low \par \par \uc2  of 105.55, according to Reuters data, while euro/sterling \par \par \uc2  dropped to 62.92 pence. \par \par \uc2  Euro/dollar moves pushed dollar/Swiss to a four-month \par \par \uc2  high above 1.58 francs. December S&P futures slipped to three-week lows at 104, in line with a fall in euro/yen. \par \par \uc2  ((London Capital Markets +44 171 542 6320, \par \par \uc2  carolyn.cohn@reuters.com)). \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  bid prices at 0836 GMT. All data taken from Reuters, \par \par \uc2  with percent change calculated from the daily U.S. close taken \par \par \uc2  from Reuters Graphics at 2130 GMT. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2    LAST    U.S. CLOSE   % CHANGE   YTD % \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1.0152  1.0185\tab  - 0.32     - 13.39\par 104.06  104.27\tab  + 0.20     -  8.10\par 105.69  106.21\tab  - 0.49     - 19.83\par 1.5772  1.5698\tab  + 0.47     + 14.83\par 1.6135  1.6125\tab  + 0.06     - 2.44\par 1.4670  1.4662\tab  + 0.05     - 4.09\par 0.6367  0.6360\tab  + 0.11     + 4.12\par 1.6019  1.6000\tab  + 0.12     - 0.62\par 0.6291  0.6311\tab  - 0.32     - 10.40\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvbq0971m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
