\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  Boosts Funds For  \highlight22\uc2 Currency Intervention \highlight\uc2  -Nikkei \b0\par\par\uc2 290 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 November 1999\par 21:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (Nikkei)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  has decided to raise the ceiling for issuance of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  fund financing bills from the Y39 trillion earmarked in the initial budget for fiscal 1999 to Y49 trillion in the second supplementary budget draft, the Nihon Keizai Shimbun reported. \par \par \uc2  The ministry was authorized by a 1951 law to issue this type of financing bill from its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  fund special account to fill any fund shortage resulting from \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions. In principal, the bills are to be redeemed within a year, but the ministry isn't required to report the amount of issues. \par \par \uc2  Although the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market has been enjoying a relative calm with the dollar hovering in a tight range around 105 yen, Japan may be guarding against a situation where the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  suddenly loses ground against the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the newspaper said. \par \par \uc2  Because Japan has repeatedly and, in most cases, single-handedly conducted massive \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year to stem declines of the dollar against the yen, its foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves grew to the highest-ever level of about $272.7 billion by the end of October. \par \par \uc2  For this, yen funds set aside for market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  appear to have decreased. The increase at the supplementary budget stage will be the first in 12 years and the size of the increase will be the biggest ever for any one-time hike, the report said. \par \par \uc2  The ceiling of the bill issuance topped the Y20 trillion level for the first time in the second supplementary budget for fiscal 1987, rising to Y33 trillion in the initial budget for fiscal 1995 and to Y39 trillion in the initial budget for fiscal 1996. \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dvbq0873l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
