\par\par \b \uc2  Yen fades as nervous market puts safety first. \b0\par\par\uc2 543 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 November 1999\par 08:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO Nov 2 (Reuters) - The yen parted with some of its recent gains on Tuesday as a bout of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  jitters prompted short-covering against a range of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The approach of a Tokyo market holiday on Wednesday fed the desire to square-up, with many dealers remembering past occasions when the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  had taken advantage of a local holiday to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "It's just been a case of people taking the safe option today," said a dealer at a U.S. bank. "Doesn't mean the dollar's downtrend has changed or anything. There's still loads of offers from here to 105.30." \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par By 0630 GMT the dollar had strolled to 104.90/95 yen\tab   from 104.15/18 late in New York on Monday, but remained within the past week's 103.70/105.30 trading range.\par The shortcovering extended to the crosses where the euro bounced to 110.41 yen\tab      from 109.51 in New York.\par But the euro was confined to a tight 20-tick range against the dollar to stand at $1.0524/28\tab   from $1.0512/15 in the U.S. on Monday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The dollar dipped in early trade as speculative sellers out of Hong Kong tried to force a break of 103.70 support, where a host of options strikes and stop-loss sales are believed to be lurking.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But they only got as far as 103.96 before the rot was stopped by bids from Japanese trust banks, which in turn stoked speculation the BOJ might be behind the buying.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Traders say the ground from 103.70 yen right down to 103.00 is crowded with stop-loss offers and options positions which, while tempting to speculators, also raise the risks of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The BOJ knows full well that all those stops are there, and knows that if they're triggered the dollar could see 100.00 (yen) in a hurry," said the U.S. bank dealer.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "That means it's more likely to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to prevent such a selloff from happening. It's something of a Mexican standoff (impasse)," he added.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The inclination to cover short was also encouraged by rumours that the Japanese government's fiscal package would actually be smaller than the market anticipated.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers were unsure where the talk originated but noted it went against all the recent evidence, which pointed to a spending package of at least the 10 trillion yen the market has long expected.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Details of the final amount are due to be announced by the government around November 10.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par For the euro, traders reported few flows against the U.S. dollar despite speculation the European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would raise interest rates at its council meeting on Thursday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers said local investors were discouraged by a political scandal fast enveloping French Finance Minister Dominique Strauss-Kahn.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Allegations that he took kickbacks could force the market-friendly minister to resign, and traders are concerned any replacement would be a more traditional socialist.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par French Prime Minister Lionel Jospin is due to make a statement on the affair later on Tuesday. ((Wayne Cole, Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3 3432 8584 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010909dvb200ysv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
